    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lăcrĭmātĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacrŭm-</span></b> ),
			ōnis, f.
		id., 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a weeping</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Esp. as a disease: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculo rum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 23 praef.</span></i>
			 5, § 9; <i><span class="en">id. 11, 37, 54, § 147</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In gen.:
			lacrimatio et fletus, Vulg Tob. 3, 22.</div>
